#
#  ---- Things that were silently broken -------------------------------------------------------
#  [FIX]  Lane SQL protocol detection had stopped probing lanes since v2.6.7 (its timer ran
#         as a .GetNewClosure() closure, where every $script: variable is a separate, empty
#         one). Rewritten without closures; File-protocol lanes get their SQL-enable task
#         again (also from .exe / irm|iex launches, re-checked at most every 15 min).
#  [FIX]  Lane connections: SqlServer module 22+ encrypts by default and lanes use
#         self-signed certificates, so every Invoke-Sqlcmd to a lane was refused and fell
#         back to file drops. Lane connection strings (and cached ones) now trust the
#         server certificate; Normalize_Sql_ConnectionString finally adds it too.
#  [FIX]  SqlClient fallback (no SQL module installed) was broken wherever a
#         SqlConnectionStringBuilder property was assigned (PowerShell treats it as a
#         dictionary): Edit_TBS_SCL_ver520_Table, Troubleshoot_ScaleCommApp, IshidaSDPs,
#         Retrieve_Nodes / Insert_Test_Item timeouts.
#  [FIX]  These no longer require a SQL PowerShell module at all (SqlClient or file drop):
#         Process_Server, Manage_Sa_Account, Process_Lanes, Close_Open_Transactions,
#         Send_SMS_Key_to_Lanes, Repair_LOC_Databases_On_Lanes, Update_ScaleConfig_And_DB,
#         Configure_Scale_Sub-Departments.
#  [FIX]  Send_SMS_Key_to_Lanes: the SQL-auth fallback sent the password "TB" ("TB$upp0rT"
#         in double quotes expanded $upp0rT to nothing).
#  [FIX]  Test-Hosts_Parallel never ran in parallel (scriptblocks on runspace-less pool
#         threads always threw) and fell back to serial Test-Connection: 8 dead hosts took
#         32 s. Now async DNS + Ping: 12 targets in 0.6 s (Ping All, VNC export, ...).
#  [FIX]  One-shot "Set Time on Lanes" never used schtasks (/sc once without /st); the
#         server IP is resolved once per run.
#  [FIX]  Startup test item job never started since v2.6.6 (Get-Job -Name with -State).
#  [FIX]  Elevation: a packaged .exe started without arguments never elevated, and script
#         paths with spaces were split on relaunch.
#  [FIX]  App icon + banner logo were never drawn; the modern menu renderer never compiled.
#  [FIX]  Quarterly health maintenance launched the TBS .exe itself (instead of PowerShell)
#         from the packaged app, and recorded non-elevated runs as done for 3 months.
#  [FIX]  Launch-time VNC export failed whenever it had to look up passwords (the job was
#         missing Test-Hosts_Parallel).
#  [FIX]  Remove_Archive_Bit assigned $host (read-only automatic variable): every UNC
#         office path threw, so the local-share shortcut never worked.
#  [FIX]  Pick_And_Update_IshidaSDPs always reported "SDP_TAB returned 0 rows" when a SQL
#         module was installed.
#  [FIX]  Enable SQL Protocols: the Named Pipes probe used doubled backslashes and never
#         worked; Protocol_Results.txt lines could be glued together.
#
#  ---- Data safety --------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  [FIX]  Backups (server DB, Storeman ZIP, lane DB) deleted the oldest backup BEFORE
#         taking the new one - a failing backup cost a good one. Rotation is after success.
#  [FIX]  Pump_Tables (SQL path): empty + bulk copy now run in one lane transaction; a
#         failed copy used to leave the lane with an empty or half-filled table.
#  [FIX]  Update_Lane_Config (SQL path) dropped and re-created RUN/LNK/STO/TER_TAB from the
#         server's column list (losing indexes and unrelated RUN_TAB rows). It now does the
