#  [FIX]  Edit_TBS_SCL_ver520_Table: scales with a NULL brand/model/IP part were never saved
#         (no match on the original keys); the save now reports rows not matched.
#  [FIX]  Insert_Test_Item could treat a real PLU as free and delete/overwrite it when its
